        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Small-scale floral design, perhaps adapted from Morris designs of the 1880's such as \"Even lode\" or the background of \"Medway\" and issued after Morris's death. All four samples are full loom widths, in red (.15), blue (.16), Greenish blue (.17), and green (.18). Corner cut out of lower right of 1976.18"@en ;
